</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>But there’s a Person in my spirit now,</l><l>Born as a babe so small, so weak, so low;</l><l>Who by the Word’s pure milk will grow to be</l><l>The overcoming inner man in me</l><l>To gain my heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Christ as my Person must possess my heart</l><l>And be preeminent in every part.</l><l>The former owner died but haunts it still.</l><l>O Lord, move in; my mind, emotion, will</l><l>Now welcome Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In spirit mingled, we are one, O Lord,</l><l>The human and divine in one accord;</l><l>Yet Thou must have a proper faculty</l><l>That all Thy glorious personality</l><l>May be expressed.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>So, Lord, I give my heart to Thee today,</l><l>That it may be Thy home in every way,</l><l>A place for Thee to come and settle down,</l><l>And all Thy grand recovery work to crown</l><l>In one new man.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
